  "$comment": "Extra knowledge-graph nodes (processes, submission artifacts) and explicit edges. Stages, requirements, conflicts, sources, resources and manuscript sections become nodes automatically, and their edges are derived in src/lib/model.ts from the other data files: stage leads_to next stage, stage depends_on its prerequisites, stage requires requirement and required resource, requirement explained_by source, document downloaded_from source, conflict conflicts_with requirement, section requires requirement.",
